 "queue": "security",
 "summary": "URGENT: Ruth Adeyemi (E039, Recruiter, HR) reports she received an email with a 'candidate resume' link. It opened a Microsoft-style sign-in page with a suspicious URL, and she entered her password before noticing. Nothing loaded afterward. Possible credential phishing. Please review her account for suspicious sign-ins, consider forcing a password and MFA reset, and check whether other staff received the same email. The helpdesk cannot reset passwords over chat; the employee will use the self-service portal per POL-PWD-01 unless Security directs otherwise."
